          %h2#References References
          %p Section C1.5 and C3.3 of
          %ul#Johnstone
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Johnstone"}> Peter Johnstone
              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sketches+of+an+Elephant"} Sketches of an Elephant
              \.
          %p A variant is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marta+Bunge"}> Marta Bunge
              , Funk,
              %em Quasi locally connected toposes
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/18/8/18-08.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            Discussion of characterizations of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sites"} sites
            of definition of locally connected toposes is in
